[00:17.460]Oh Take a look in the mirror you look so sad
{"噢　对着镜子看看吧　你看起来如此悲伤"}
[00:25.500]It's so cold like that winter market we used to go
{"寒冷刺骨　就像我们曾去的冬日市集"}
[00:32.800]I don't cry anymore but I feel so hurt
{"我不再哭泣　但内心仍隐隐作痛"}
[00:42.000]So I don't need you to close to me
{"所以我不需要你靠近我"}
[00:45.570]You don't hear me so you said
{"你听不见我的心声　却这样说着"}
[00:48.790]I don't know why things have changed since yesterday
{"不知为何　从昨天起一切都变了"}
[00:57.140]This could be love again
{"这份感情或许能重燃"}
[01:01.070]All I need is you
{"我唯一需要的只有你"}
[01:05.050]Comeback, I'm waiting, Anytime
{"回来吧　我随时都在等待"}
[01:10.070]The heavy rains come
{"倾盆大雨落下"}
[01:13.110]Still I miss days with you
{"依然怀念与你共度的时光"}
[01:17.290]I can't look into your face
{"我无法直视你的脸庞"}
[01:20.340]Oh Feeling blue and looking back again
{"噢　忧郁弥漫　又一次回首往事"}
[01:27.150]Please come back to me
{"请回到我身边"}
